ority, assignee, label)\n- **ProjectOverviewTab component**: Tests for description editing, milestones, and key metrics display\n\n### 3. Playwright Configuration\n\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\n```typescript\n- Test directory: ./tests\n- Timeout: 60 seconds (expect timeout: 10 seconds)\n- Parallel execution: Enabled (fullyParallel: true)\n- Retries: 0\n- Reporters: Replay recorder, JSON, and HTML\n- Base URL: http://localhost:8888\n- Action timeout: 15 seconds\n```\n\n### 4. Existing Test Files Related to Projects\n\n```\n- project-card.spec.ts - Tests for ProjectCard component\n- projects-page-filters.spec.ts - Tests for ProjectFilters\n- projects-create-modal.spec.ts - Tests for CreateProjectModal\n- project-header.spec.ts - Tests for ProjectHeader component\n- project-header-lead-progress.spec.ts - Tests for lead selector and progress bar\n```\n\nTest files use API helpers for:\n- `loginViaApi()` - Authenticate users\n- `getProjectsData()` - Fetch projects list with metadata\n- `getProjectDetail()` - Fetch detailed project info including issues\n- `createProjectViaApi()` - Create test projects\n- `deleteProjectViaApi()` - Clean up test data\n\n### 5. Project Detail Page Component\n\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/ProjectDetail.tsx`\n\n- Fetches project data on mount using `fetchProjectDetail` thunk\n- Manages active tab state (issues/overview)\n- Renders `ProjectHeader`, `ProjectIssuesTab`, or `ProjectOverviewTab` based on active tab\n- Handles loading and error states\n- Clears project detail state on unmount\n\n### 6. Related Components\n\n**ProjectHeader** (`/src/components/ProjectHeader.tsx` - 367 lines)\n- Displays project name (inline-editable)\n- Status badge with dropdown selector\n- Progress bar (shows completed/total issues)\n- Target date field with date picker\n- Lead selector with searchable member list\n- Tab switcher for Issues/Overview\n- Uses `updateProjectField` thunk for persisting changes\n\n**ProjectIssuesTab** (`/src/components/ProjectIssuesTab.tsx` - 290 lines)\n- Groups issues by team with collapsible headers\n- Issue count per team\n- Issue rows with checkboxes for bulk selection\n- Bulk actions toolbar showing selected count\n- Bulk action buttons: Status, Priority, Assignee, Label\n- Uses `toggleProjectIssueSelection`, `clearProjectIssueSelection`, `bulkUpdateProjectIssues`\n- Empty state when no issues\n\n**ProjectOverviewTab** (`/src/components/ProjectOverviewTab.tsx` - 400+ lines)\n- Description section (editable)\n- Milestones section with add/edit/delete/complete actions\n- Key metrics display (total, completed, in progress, remaining issues)\n- Uses markdown-like rendering for descriptions\n\n**ProjectCard** (`/src/components/ProjectCard.tsx` - 114 lines)\n- Links to project detail page\n- Shows status badge with styling classes\n- Lead avatar and name\n- Target date with calendar icon\n- Progress bar with percentage and issue count\n- Team icons (identifiers) for participating teams\n\n**ProjectFilters** (`/src/components/ProjectFilters.tsx` - 183 lines)\n- Three filter dropdowns: Status, Lead, Team\n- Multi-select with checkboxes\n- Active filter indicators with badge counts\n- Status options: Planned, In Progress, Completed, Cancelled\n- Lead selector with member avatars\n- Team selector with team names\n- Click-outside to close dropdowns\n\n### 7. Netlify Functions for Projects\n\n**project-detail.ts** (208 lines)\n- GET endpoint: `/api/project-detail?projectId=...`\n- Fetches project with lead info, issue counts\n- Fetches all project issues grouped by team with full details (title, status, priority, assignee, labels)\n- Fetches milestones, all members, all labels, and activity log\n- Returns enriched data with team info and label details\n\n**projects.ts** (213 lines)\n- GET: Fetches all projects with lead info, issue counts, and team associations\n- Fetches all members and teams for filters\n- POST: Creates new project with name, description, status, lead, target date\n- DELETE: Deletes project and cleans up related data (issues, milestones, activity)\n\n**update-project.ts** (193 lines)\n- PUT endpoint: Updates individual project fields\n- Supports: name, status, description, targetDate, leadId\n- Creates project activity entries for changes\n- Validates required fields (name cannot be empty)\n- Returns updated project with latest activity entry\n- Activity messages include context (e.g., \"changed status from Planned to In Progress\")\n\n**bulk-update-issues.ts** (105 lines)\n- PUT endpoint: `/api/bulk-update-issues`\n- Updates multiple issues with: status, priority, assigneeId, labelId\n- Validates status and priority values\n- For labels, checks for existing issue_labels before inserting (prevents duplicates)\n\n### 8. Seed Data File\n\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/seed-db.ts` (197 lines)\n\n**Created Data**:\n- Workspace: \"Acme Corp\"\n- Members: Alice Johnson (admin), Bob Smith (member), Carol Davis (member)\n- Teams: Engineering (ENG), Design (DES)\n- Labels: Bug (red), Feature (green), Improvement (blue), Documentation (purple)\n- Project: \"V2 Launch\" with Alice as lead, target date 2026-06-30, status in_progress\n- Issues: 8 for Engineering team (6 with project assignment) + 3 for Design team (all with project assignment)\n- Milestones: 2 for V2 Launch (API Complete, Beta Launch)\n- Notifications: 3 for Alice (assignment, update, mention)\n\n### 9. Redux Store Slices\n\n**projectDetailSlice.ts** (363 lines)\n- State: project, issues, milestones, members, labels, activity, loading, error, selectedIssueIds\n- Thunks:\n  - `fetchProjectDetail` - Loads project with all related data\n  - `updateProjectField` - Updates single field (name, status, description, targetDate, leadId)\n  - `createMilestone`, `updateMilestone`, `deleteMilestone`\n  - `updateProjectIssueStatus` - Changes issue status\n  - `bulkUpdateProjectIssues` - Bulk updates multiple issues\n- Actions: `toggleProjectIssueSelection`, `clearProjectIssueSelection`, `clearProjectDetail`\n- Handles cross-slice updates (when issuesSlice updates status, it also updates project counts)\n\n**projectsSlice.ts** (130 lines)\n- State: items (projects), members, teams, loading, error\n- Thunks:\n  - `fetchProjects` - Gets all projects with metadata\n  - `createProject` - Creates new project\n- Actions: None\n- Stores list of all projects and available members/teams for filtering\n\n**issuesSlice.ts** (153 lines)\n- State: myIssues, loading, error\n- Thunks:\n  - `fetchMyIssues` - Gets issues assigned to current user\n  - `createIssue` - Creates new issue\n  - `updateIssueStatus` - Changes issue status\n\n### Key Architectural Patterns\n\n1. **Inline Editing**: Components use local state + refs for edit mode with keyboard handlers (Enter to save, Escape to cancel)\n2. **Dropdowns**: Click-outside pattern with useRef and useEffect\n3. **Bulk Actions**: Selection state stored in Redux, bulk actions trigger thunks that dispatch refetch\n4. **Cross-Slice Communication**: projectDetailSlice listens to issuesSlice actions and updates project counts\n5. **API Helpers**: Test files use custom helpers for common API operations (login, create, delete)\n6. **Activity Logging**: Backend creates activity entries automatically when projects are updated\n7. **Nested Grouping**: Issues grouped by team in UI with collapse/expand functionality\n8. **Progress Calculation**: Uses \"done\" status to calculate completion percentage\n\n### File Paths (Absolute)\n\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/playwright.config.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/seed-db.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/ProjectDetail.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/Projects.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/ProjectHeader.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/ProjectIssuesTab.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/ProjectOverviewTab.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/ProjectCard.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/ProjectFilters.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/CreateProjectModal.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/projectDetailSlice.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/projectsSlice.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/issuesSlice.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/project-detail.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/projects.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/update-project.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/bulk-update-issues.ts`"}],"totalDurationMs":58837,"totalTokens":87516,"totalToolUseCount":33,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4651,"cache_read_input_tokens":79985,"output_tokens":2879,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4651},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
